  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">How it started</h2>
    <div class="story">
      <p>
        In 2025 we launched Investor Office Hours — intimate sessions that
        paired 24 investors with 350 founders across 21 editions.
      </p>
      <p>
        Super Office Hours scales that proven format into a single high-intensity
        day: 50 investors, 200 startups, 400 structured meetings.
      </p>
      <p>
        The goal remains the same — end the day with real term sheets and
        real hires, not business cards.
      </p>
